 \Omega_i=\bigcup_{r\in[20/71,1]}B(c_i(r),\delta),\qquad
 U_\epsilon=\bigcup_{\lambda\in[0,51/20]}B(\lambda,\epsilon).
\]

Every child subset must refer to genuine successors of the existing geometric
